OL,3,GNEWSAFoyle Pride attracts thousands to
OL,4,ALondonderry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people were in Londonderry
OL,7,Fon Saturday for the 2026 Foyle Pride
OL,8,Fparade.
OL,10,FNow in its 33rd year, Foyle Pride is
OL,11,Fdescribed by organisers as a
OL,12,Fcelebration of diversity and
OL,13,Finclusiveness, with a wide range of
OL,14,Fevents on offer, including theatre
OL,15,Fperformances, workshops, discussions
OL,16,Fand exhibitions.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
