OL,3,GNEWSAFoyle Pride attracts thousands to
OL,4,ALondonderry
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoyle Pride committee member Mary
OL,7,FMolloy said the committee, which is
OL,8,Fmade up entirely of volunteers, worked
OL,9,Fincredibly hard to ensure the festival
OL,10,Fwas an inclusive and welcoming space
OL,11,Ffor everyone.
OL,13,FThe parade left from the North West
OL,14,FTransport Hub in the Waterside and
OL,15,Ffollowed the 1968 civil rights route
OL,16,Fbefore finishing at Guildhall Square.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
